---
description: >-
  Minimal smoke example: a single "Review Agent" flow container chaining the
  four core node shapes (input, task, tool, decision) in sequence.
---
agentflow-beta TB
  flow reviewer["Review Agent"]
    changes["Gather changes"]@{ shape: input }
    analyse["Analyse diff"]@{ shape: task }
    lint["run_linter"]@{ shape: tool }
    ok["Clean?"]@{ shape: decision }

    changes --> analyse --> lint --> ok
  end
